    "",
    " op0 -- a vector with a scatter brush: every parameter is kept, the seed included (it is what makes",
    "        the marks the same on every client).",
    " op1 -- setProps replaces the brush by a stretch one with a different tip.",
    " op2 -- a spacing below 0.05 is REJECTED and the stroke stays as op1 left it.",
    " op3 -- an angle jitter above 180 is REJECTED on creation: the node never exists.",
    " op4 -- a NONE brush is the plain stroke and its parameters are not read, so even a negative spacing",
    "        is kept as sent (the validators of both sides must agree on this edge too).",
    " op5 -- a brush with an unknown tip is REJECTED.",
    "Note proto3: dot (0) and DOT tip / NONE kind are the defaults, so they do not appear in `expected`."
